00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:37.340
Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:50.830
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:53.160
Which one is this?

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:56.800
closed captions

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:55.180
Is this the all-correct room?

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:57.300
Or did I make a mistake?

00:01:57.630 --> 00:01:58.790
Ichigo-chan!

00:02:00.530 --> 00:02:06.510
recipe 15

00:02:00.530 --> 00:02:06.510
The Rose Water of Memories

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:11.470
Everyone!

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:12.840
Congratulations.

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:14.360
You got all of the questions right.

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:16.490
But this result was expected.

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:20.300
Y-Yay!

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:21.810
I passed!

00:02:21.810 --> 00:02:23.970
It's all because of everybody's special training!

00:02:21.810 --> 00:02:23.970
Alright alright, make way!

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:25.030
Make way!

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:27.080
Ichigo-chan.

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:28.730
Are you alright?

00:02:30.490 --> 00:02:31.980
A second year kid, huh?

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:35.130
There is nothing to celebrate about by just passing such test.

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:36.570
What!

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:39.630
Is that your attitude after pushing a girl down?

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:41.340
It's you who really behaves like a child.

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:42.690
What did you say!?

00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:45.410
You are too cheeky against your senpai!

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:46.670
Please stop this.

00:02:46.670 --> 00:02:48.260
I'm alright anyway.

00:02:48.260 --> 00:02:49.140
Right, Hanabusa-kun?

00:02:49.510 --> 00:02:51.790
Hey! What are you doing to the Sweets Prince!?

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:53.150
Hanabusa-kun looks really pitable!

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:54.640
That's right! That's right!

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:00.890
What's with that person?

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:03.370
Are you alright? You look pale!

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:07.230
You just witnessed my ugly side.

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:08.290
Give me a moment.

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:10.500
It's back to normal.

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.140
You're talking about yourself?

00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:13.570
Is there any problem with that?

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:19.620
Hanabusa-kun is really hard to understand as usual.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:21.880
Everyone, please keep quiet.

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:26.270
There are 10 third-year groups which remained after the test.

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:28.190
5 second-year groups.

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:31.730
1 first-year group, a total of 16 groups.

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:35.160
Eh? There are only 5 second year groups?

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:37.660
As we thought, the third-years are strong.

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:39.250
Koshiro-san and the others remained too.

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:48.170
Repeating the old announcement I made.

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:51.460
The question for the first round with pound cake.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:54.170
The theme is sweets that can be shared with the family.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:55.640
Family...

00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:58.790
Everyone in each group shall make 1.

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:02.280
So each group will make 4 pound cakes.

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:06.190
And then, put all 4 of them in a basket to be graded.

00:04:06.190 --> 00:04:07.550
I see.

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:09.850
It's the test of the individual's ability.

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:16.890
Not just that, as a team, to able to follow the theme of "family"...

00:04:16.890 --> 00:04:18.360
Teamwork is also tested.

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:19.890
I see.

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:21.600
What kind of cake should I make?

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:23.820
Well then, Karashima-sensei.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:26.370
Please announce the group lineup for the first round.

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:29.440
The representative who is called, please come up on stage.

00:04:31.190 --> 00:04:32.560
Middle school 3C.

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:33.440
Team Yamada.

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:36.220
The opposition will be...

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:37.360
Middle school 3D.

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:38.670
Team Nari.

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:42.790
If it's possible, please let us fight against a weak group.

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:45.360
Don't say such unconfident words.

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:48.240
I really understand Andou-kun's feelings.

00:04:48.240 --> 00:04:49.100
Middle school 3B.

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:50.450
Team Ichimatsu.

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:51.440
Middle school 2A.

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:52.220
Team Ichigo.

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:53.380
Eh?

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:55.060
See, you are being called.

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:56.780
You are our representative.

00:04:56.780 --> 00:04:59.370
Why is it Team Ichigo!?

00:04:59.370 --> 00:05:00.480
Sorry for keeping quiet about it.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.410
But it has the impact, right?

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:03.490
"Team Ichigo."

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:07.990
Eh? But I'm the only beginner of the group, ain't I?

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:09.480
Stop talking and go.

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:11.450
Alright, alright.

00:05:14.670 --> 00:05:16.750
So you are the representative of Team Ichigo.

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:20.830
To have this kid as my opponent, I think I'll win without playing.

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:22.800
The childish person from before.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:24.250
Who is!?

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:26.760
I'm the representative of Team Ichimatsu, Ichimatsu-san!

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:31.760
I-I'm Amano Ichigo. Pleased to meet you.

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:46.770
All of us are from the middle school but we have adequate ability to make cakes in Salon de Marie.

00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:49.770
You! Enough of this!

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:51.450
Ichigo-chan, are you alright?

00:05:52.010 --> 00:05:56.200
If you lose to us in this match, change your names to "Loser Princes".

00:05:58.590 --> 00:06:00.640
Don't worry, Ichigo-chan.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:04.920
That kind of person won't be able to make good sweets.

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:10.510
Congratulations on passing the test.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:13.790
Thank you, good job on staying under my hat.

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:17.130
Geez, Ichigo, you really gave all of us a fright.

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:19.810
What would've happened if you got them wrong!?

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:21.980
That's...

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:23.730
That's why I said it's alright!

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:27.860
As the partner of her, you should pull yourselves together...

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:29.000
What did you say?

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:30.950
It's not the time to fight.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:36.330
You bought Ichimatsu's cake from Salon de Marie for research, right?

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:37.310
That's right.

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:38.460
Let's hurry up and taste it.

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:44.950
This is coffe marble.

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:47.460
Pâtissier

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:47.470
Shima Reimata

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:47.470
(Middle School 3B)

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:47.470
It's made pretty well.

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:49.480
This one is nut flavoured.

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:51.970
Pâtissier

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:51.990
Yokoshima Shige

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:51.990
(Middle School 3B)

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:51.990
It tastes good, it's really well made.

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:53.670
This chocolate pound...

00:06:53.670 --> 00:06:56.180
Pâtissier

00:06:53.670 --> 00:06:56.200
Amikawa Ryou

00:06:53.670 --> 00:06:56.200
(Middle School 3B)

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:56.200
Delicious. It's really delicious.

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:58.200
This is chestnut.

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:00.690
Pâtissier

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:00.690
Ichimatsu Takeshi

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:00.690
(Middle School 3B)

00:06:58.440 --> 00:07:00.690
It has an adult flavour to it.

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:03.800
We're only praising it...

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:05.950
Alright, alright, alright!

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:08.620
That's enough worrying behind the scenes.

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:12.700
This just means we have to make the cake better than the opponent's.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:15.280
What kind of cake is everyone making?

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:17.150
That's right.

00:07:17.150 --> 00:07:19.380
The theme is "family"...

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:23.300
I wonder if I should make a strawberry pound cake that makes children happy.

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:26.800
Yeah, it's an idea which has Ichigo's style.

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:31.700
Then, I shall make a full of flavour chocolate walnut pound cake.

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:34.300
It's really a cake for adults.

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:38.070
I will make sugared red beans maccha pound cake.

00:07:38.070 --> 00:07:40.310
Andou's cake is really suitable for the elderly.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:44.750
What's the matter, Satsuki?

00:07:46.420 --> 00:07:47.320
Wait.

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:48.680
It's a rare sight.

00:07:48.680 --> 00:07:50.310
That you didn't get an idea.

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:51.790
It's alright.

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:53.600
Since we still have time.

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:56.380
First, let's try making our cakes.

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:57.210
Yeah.

00:07:57.210 --> 00:08:00.260
Alright! Team Ichigo, go for it!

00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:02.330
How can you all become "Loser Princes"!?

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:04.030
Drop the "loser" part.

00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:06.750
Then, "Bad Princes".

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:09.550
Or... How about the Rose Loser Princes?

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:11.940
Like I said, we haven't lost yet!

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:13.830
Then, how about...

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:24.690
Alright, it's completed.

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:31.990
Mine turned out so-so, I guess.

00:08:34.270 --> 00:08:36.270
Yeah, it's just like what I had imagined.

00:08:38.730 --> 00:08:40.590
Well then, let's start.

00:08:40.590 --> 00:08:41.500
Oui!

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:42.990
Magical macaron!

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:43.650
Sweets!

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:44.370
Romance!

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:45.590
Card!

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:47.690
Come out!

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:52.050
We sent three cards in one go.

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:54.690
The Queen must be really pleased.

00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:57.640
What's left is Satsuki's...

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:01.770
I wonder if he thought of a good idea.

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:04.780
Well, he did think of something...

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:12.300
Rose pound cake...

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:15.410
Would you try tasting it?

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:18.660
I added edible natural rose water.

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:27.110
The taste of the rose didn't come out.

00:09:27.110 --> 00:09:29.210
Yeah, I wonder why.

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:30.710
It's burnt.

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:32.170
The taste of the rose is burnt away.

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:35.270
As I thought, it's not possible.

00:09:35.270 --> 00:09:38.420
Then, why not try to put more rose water in it?

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:40.220
The result will be the same.

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:42.160
Then, try sprinkling it directly.

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:42.880
Ah, wait!

00:09:49.550 --> 00:09:51.360
I-I'm sorry.

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:55.450
It's okay. I can still remake the cake with this amount.

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:56.070
But...

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:58.050
It's a really strong smell.

00:09:58.180 --> 00:10:00.300
True, it's really strong.

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:02.320
What, what's this smell!?

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:03.260
Perfume?

00:10:03.260 --> 00:10:05.060
It's so stinky that I can't bear it.

00:10:06.360 --> 00:10:09.000
What are you all making!?

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:11.510
What are these?

00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:12.750
It's a rose cake.

00:10:13.490 --> 00:10:15.080
So it's this.

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:17.490
This rose water really stinks.

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:18.310
Where did you get it?

00:10:18.310 --> 00:10:19.260
Give it back!

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:25.420
You all better think a bit.

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:28.890
This isn't a toliet smell competition.

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:32.630
Are you going to call me immature again?

00:10:32.630 --> 00:10:34.910
I'm only saying this out of concern to my kouhai.

00:10:34.910 --> 00:10:36.610
Using such cheap perfume.

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:39.580
How good can the cake made be?

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:46.580
What's with those guys?

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:48.250
Fool!

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:50.750
Don't even mention the Grand Prix, you might even get yourself expelled!

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:52.080
B-But...

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:56.610
All of the effort you put in till now would've been wasted.

00:10:56.610 --> 00:10:58.430
I'm sorry.

00:10:58.430 --> 00:11:02.510
But why, tell me, Hanabusa-kun.

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:05.220
Why are you so affixed in making a rose cake?

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:13.290
A rose's image is slightly different from a family's.

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:16.640
Yeah, when you're saying it, I agree to it as well.

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:18.080
Why do you have to use rose?

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:25.400
I'm really sorry, I shall go and clear my head.

00:11:25.400 --> 00:11:27.660
Hey, Satuski. Wait for me!

00:11:28.570 --> 00:11:30.180
Hanabusa-kun...

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:46.680
What's wrong?

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:49.000
Hanabusa-kun hasn't returned yet.

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:50.120
Just leave him be.

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:52.060
He will return once he has settled down.

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:54.900
We'll do what we can, we have a lot to do anyway.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:55.900
How can that be...

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:58.170
It seems to be really complicated.

00:11:58.170 --> 00:12:01.570
What exactly should we do to help him?

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:05.950
Satsuki said I can't follow him.

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:09.200
I'm going to become an unwanted Spirit!

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:11.590
You're exaggerating too much.

00:12:11.590 --> 00:12:14.620
He might just want to be alone.

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:16.210
Is that so?

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:19.130
That's right, cheer up!

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:20.920
Better blow your nose first!

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:24.040
Thanks.

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:29.020
What are you doing!?

00:12:29.020 --> 00:12:30.640
You stupid pervert ill-mannered person!

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:32.780
Calm down, calm down.

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:39.710
Cafe-kun, do you know why Hanabusa-kun got so worked up about roses?

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:42.220
He didn't tell me the reason.

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:47.660
But late yesterday night, he was staring at the bottle of rose water.

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:51.660
That must be very important to him.

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:54.150
I'll go talk to Hanabusa-kun.

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:57.750
Because we are friends!

00:12:57.750 --> 00:12:59.140
We are a team, right!?

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:00.120
Amano...

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:05.680
If one has a problem, if he doesn't tell, how can we help him?

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:07.890
That's why I'm going!

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:12.890
Hanabusa-kun said before,

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:17.880
that his mother teaches flower arrangement and his father is an actor who specializes in roses.

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:19.810
There must be a relation to this somewhere.

00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:23.820
Ichigo-chan...

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:31.630
How are the two of them doing?

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:33.320
You aren't doing your work.

00:13:36.450 --> 00:13:40.250
Ichigo and Hanabusa must be talking by now.

00:13:41.760 --> 00:13:45.220
The distance between them might close up too.

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:48.390
As I thought, you're worried about them.

00:13:49.110 --> 00:13:51.430
Because of the words Amano said...

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:54.280
Because we are friends!

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:55.270
We are a team, right!?

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:59.270
We are friends, huh?

00:13:59.850 --> 00:14:02.970
Geez... I can't work!

00:14:02.970 --> 00:14:03.980
Let's go too!

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:05.060
Yeah.

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:10.180
I see.

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:12.700
You remembered what I said before.

00:14:13.020 --> 00:14:14.170
Yeah.

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:19.380
I was wondering if this is related to your father and mother.

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:20.380
That's right.

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:23.130
I think it's alright to say it to Ichigo-chan.

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:23.940
Really?

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:26.920
Eh? But you didn't even want to tell me!

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:30.330
Because I treat girls kindly.

00:14:37.900 --> 00:14:40.020
It's just as you said.

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:43.060
My image of family is roses.

00:14:44.970 --> 00:14:47.730
My father and mother really likes sweets.

00:14:47.730 --> 00:14:50.130
My mother often baked cakes for us to eat.

00:14:50.550 --> 00:14:54.860
I grew up during my childhood surrounded by the influence of cakes and roses.

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:58.400
Mama's cakes are always delicious, whenever we eat them.

00:14:58.400 --> 00:14:59.660
Right, Satsuki?

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:02.330
Yeah, Papa looks really delighted!

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:06.880
Because everything Papa likes has gathered in one place.

00:15:07.690 --> 00:15:09.290
Mama and...

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:12.190
Satsuki and...

00:15:13.610 --> 00:15:15.040
Roses and...

00:15:16.070 --> 00:15:17.890
Sweets.

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:19.600
This is the best.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:22.320
Then, I want to become a pâtissier!

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:23.590
Why?

00:15:23.590 --> 00:15:27.960
Because as long Papa and Mama have me and sweets, you all will be happy, right?

00:15:27.960 --> 00:15:30.480
So, when I grow up, I will open up a shop,

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:32.430
and decorate it with Papa's and Mama's flowers.

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:35.070
And then, I will make rose cakes!

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:38.000
That's why you enrolled in St. Marie!

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:40.080
Hanabusa's dream will definitely come true!

00:15:42.610 --> 00:15:44.830
No, it can't come true anymore.

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:46.380
Eh?

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:49.840
A few years ago, when Papa went to Paris for work...

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:53.730
Satsuki, didn't you say you want to make rose cakes?

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:54.740
Roses...

00:15:54.740 --> 00:15:56.350
How long ago did I say that?

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:59.350
It's Damascus natural rose water.

00:15:59.650 --> 00:16:01.900
It's really difficult to get.

00:16:02.300 --> 00:16:05.050
I'm returning to Japan immediately, look forward to it.

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:09.570
I've already left rose cakes in my past.

00:16:09.930 --> 00:16:11.740
But my father remembered it.

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:16.390
My father, in order to get to Japan earlier, boarded an earlier plane.

00:16:16.390 --> 00:16:16.950
But...

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:24.220
Satsuki...

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:29.710
Please let mother have... happiness.

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:44.060
What's left after that is only this bottle of rose water.

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:46.770
That kind of thing happened...

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:49.020
I didn't know anything at all about that.

00:16:49.350 --> 00:16:52.410
I'm sorry. To have caused you to remember it.

00:16:52.410 --> 00:16:54.420
It's nothing. Don't worry.

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:58.830
I think it began from that time.

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:03.410
That I have to treat Mama and other girls kindly.

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:04.950
I see.

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:07.960
So Hanabusa-kun isn't just a simple stuck up person.

00:17:15.190 --> 00:17:17.210
Kashino. Andou.

00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:20.540
We're sorry. We didn't mean to eavesdrop.

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:22.750
It's just that you didn't come back.

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:25.270
That's your father's memento, isn't it?

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:28.530
We didn't know about your situation. We're really sorry.

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:32.860
No, I should've made things clear.

00:17:33.140 --> 00:17:35.860
Oh yeah, do you want to try this out?

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:52.310
The moment the tea enters the mouth, the taste of the rose immediately blooms out.

00:17:52.310 --> 00:17:53.700
It's a really natural taste.

00:17:55.640 --> 00:17:57.750
I think I understand.

00:17:57.750 --> 00:18:03.770
The feelings that Hanabusa-kun's father held when he wanted to deliver this over quickly.

00:18:04.260 --> 00:18:07.680
I also know that rose cake isn't suitable to be baked.

00:18:07.680 --> 00:18:13.610
But when I heard the theme is cakes that can be shared with the family, I wanted to try it out no matter what.

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:16.290
Let's make the rose cake!

00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:18.040
Ichigo-chan...

00:18:18.620 --> 00:18:22.230
Rose... It's true that it's a very creative idea, isn't it?

00:18:22.230 --> 00:18:23.430
Andou...

00:18:23.430 --> 00:18:24.200
That's right.

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:27.410
Compared to the common cakes made by the senpais, this one will get high points.

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:29.500
We must try everything we can think of.

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:32.460
Challenges are nothing when we are young!

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:34.580
Vanilla sounds like a really old auntie.

00:18:35.270 --> 00:18:36.830
Seems interesting.

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:38.510
Let's try and make the rose cake.

00:18:39.420 --> 00:18:40.880
Kashino...

00:18:40.880 --> 00:18:42.720
If everyone put their heads together, we will definitely be able to make it.

00:18:43.030 --> 00:18:46.090
Because we are friends.

00:18:46.090 --> 00:18:47.230
Right, Amano?

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:51.480
Yeah, I'm sure we can make a wonderful cake. Let's do our best, okay?

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:52.430
Yes!

00:18:52.430 --> 00:18:53.960
Yeah, let's do our best!

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:17.510
Rose cake really suits Hanabusa-kun!

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:26.280
What? I thought they came here to cheer.

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:29.730
Never thought they are girls who only chase after the Sweets Princes.

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:33.850
So how's it?

00:19:33.850 --> 00:19:36.640
Aren't you supposed to make four different kinds of cakes?

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:37.570
Yeah.

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:41.950
I, Kashino and Andou-kun roughly figured out ours but...

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:45.460
Hey Hanabusa-kun, can you let us taste it?

00:19:45.460 --> 00:19:48.270
Can you all be quiet!?

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:48.950
Yes!

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:52.200
Hanabusa-kun is rude to the girls?

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:53.960
Hey, the sun really rose from the west.

00:20:00.150 --> 00:20:02.850
The taste and smell disappears after baking.

00:20:02.850 --> 00:20:06.200
Sprinkling after baking, the taste will be too strong.

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:09.050
Why can't it go smoothly like rose tea?

00:20:09.050 --> 00:20:13.340
The rose taste did seep in but it only stays on the surface.

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:17.820
I tried baking it along with chocolate but the result is still the same.

00:20:18.790 --> 00:20:23.230
I also tried putting roses with the rose water but...

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:25.570
Somehow it turned out badly like this...

00:20:25.860 --> 00:20:29.580
As I thought, it won't work if the cake itself can't fix the flavour in it.

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:32.240
No... But...

00:20:37.190 --> 00:20:40.920
When my deceased father finally found some rose water to give me...

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:43.800
Could it be that I can't release its full potential?

00:20:44.670 --> 00:20:48.740
If I think about it, this thing never caused any good things to happen.

00:20:51.920 --> 00:20:55.790
Why did I say I would make a rose cake?

00:20:56.360 --> 00:20:58.520
When my father isn't here anymore.

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:04.700
Even if I can make rose sweets now...

00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:07.910
If it weren't for this, my father would...

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:09.810
If it wasn't for this...

00:21:09.810 --> 00:21:11.210
No!

